D1MzitNeWAxU1mq8BHdl1EQMQ3YcHCKwCKAE"],[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjD1MzitNeWAxU1mq8BHdl1EQMQ3YcHCK0CKAI"],[["E:KID_FRIENDLINESS"],"親子友善程度",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjD1MzitNeWAxU1mq8BHdl1EQMQ3YcHCK4CKAM"],[["E:ACCESSIBILITY"],"無障礙設施",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjD1MzitNeWAxU1mq8BHdl1EQMQ3YcHCK8CKAQ"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjD1MzitNeWAxU1mq8BHdl1EQMQ3IcHCKoCKDM",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["北海道炙燒拉麵三重五華用餐不收服務費，提供多種日式拉麵、丼飯、咖哩、冷麵、炸物和小菜。\n\n內用拉麵還可免費加半球麵一次（需要點餐時告知，付費後就不行+🚫），自助區有飲料跟霜淇淋免費自取。\n\n環境乾淨，很適合學生、上班族或家庭聚餐，是三重吃午餐、晚餐的好去處。\n\n內用空間以木質桌椅搭配灰色牆面，簡約又不失質感。\n\n燈光柔和，整體空間明亮。\n\n內用自助區提供多種飲料暢飲，喜歡吃冰的還有霜淇淋。\n\n北海道炙燒拉麵 菜單價錢\n\n菜單品項選擇多， 內用低消90元很容易達到，拉麵可免費續加一次麵。\n\n有日式拉麵、冷麵、丼飯、咖哩飯、炸物與小菜，還有學生套餐、超值博多等幾種套餐可選擇。\n\n一般都是拉麵麵條可選「拉麵」或「手打麵」，還能加麵、加湯或升級雙倍叉燒。\n\n真的很好吃！阿良的最愛。",null,[0,93]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11523755843343383412/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4VUZKdFZsRmxWMGswVVZaR1ExcFhOVmRhZW1OM1ZXcEpNR1J1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11523755843343383412/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4VUZKdFZsRmxWMGswVVZaR1ExcFhOVmRhZW1OM1ZXcEpNR1J1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11523755843343383412/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4VUZKdFZsRmxWMGswVVZaR1ExcFhOVmRhZW1OM1ZXcEpNR1J1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11523755843343383412/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4VUZKdFZsRmxWMGswVVZaR1ExcFhOVmRhZW1OM1ZXcEpNR1J1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11523755843343383412/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4VUZKdFZsRmxWMGswVVZaR1ExcFhOVmRhZW1OM1ZXcEpNR1J1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11523755843343383412/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN4VUZKdFZsRmxWMGswVVZaR1ExcFhOVmRhZW1OM1ZXcEpNR1J1WXh